  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Reel Time</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/2\">Cary Ravitz</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: Becket ccw </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">long lines forward &amp; back</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons allemande left 1½</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">star left 4 places ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">next neighbors do si do once</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p><a href=\"http://www.ibiblio.org/contradance/thecallersbox/dance.php?id=2472\">http://www.ibiblio.org/contradance/thecallersbox/dance.php?id=2472</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared to sketchbook\n          </p>\n"
